            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sulemaani ku yaaherize okushaba kwe, omuriro gwaruga omu iguru, gwayokyeza kimwe ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo, ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyaijura hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamurwa tibaabaasa kutaaha mu nju ya MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kikaijura egyo nju ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli boona ku baareebire omuriro gwashuuma, n'ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kiri ahari hekalu, bainama ahansi, baajuumara aha mabaare gaariire, baaramya, baasiima MUKAMA nibagira bati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
